# C47 project specific files
#
# The imported upstream tree lives under upstream/ (UPSTREAM_ROOT in
# .github/project/upstream-pin.env), so upstream's own build-system artefacts
# are anchored there. Simulator runtime outputs stay anchored at the repo root
# below, because the host simulator runs with the repo root as its CWD.
